Add the keys below to ios/Runner/Info.plist (inside the top-level <dict>) when you
build the iOS target with Drive sync enabled. See docs/DEVELOPMENT.md §4 for how
to obtain the iOS OAuth client ID. Keep your real client ID out of source control.

  <key>GIDClientID</key>
  <string>YOUR_IOS_CLIENT_ID.apps.googleusercontent.com</string>
  <key>CFBundleURLTypes</key>
  <array>
    <dict>
      <key>CFBundleURLSchemes</key>
      <array>
        <!-- Paste the "iOS URL scheme" exactly as shown in Google Cloud Console.
             It already starts with "com.googleusercontent.apps." — do not add
             the prefix yourself. Example: com.googleusercontent.apps.123456789-abcd -->
        <string>YOUR_REVERSED_CLIENT_ID</string>
      </array>
    </dict>
  </array>
